---
description: >-
  Every delimiter pair mindmap has, on columns and cards. Kanban draws one
  shape for all columns and one for all cards, so they all look the same.
  Covers an id-less column and card (the text is the id), a mismatched
  opener and closer, and v12's reading of the cloud pairs: e(-Cloud card-)
  has the label 'Cloud card-' and f-)Exploding card(- the id 'f-'.
---
kanban
  round(Round column)
    a((Circle card))
    b))Bang card((
    c)Cloud card(
    d{{Hexagon card}}
    e(-Cloud card-)
    f-)Exploding card(-
    g[Square card]
  [Id-less column]
    (Id-less card)
  mixed(Mismatched closer]
